        {
          "id": 1173045479,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Yes, `maxseqtobeacked` being lower than `nextseq`, the good test is the opposite. my bad.\nOtherwise, we keep bouncing on this condition which is met again and again, multiplying the number of false `ACK unseen segment` messages.",
